The hooks README documents the pre-commit wiki behavior — auto-fixing drifted links/anchors, creating or extending .wiki mesh coverage for uncovered fragment links, and re-staging only the fix deltas of files clean before the hook while leaving already-dirty pages unstaged — that .githooks/pre-commit.wiki.sh implements, with the script as the source of truth when the two disagree.
